<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main class="container page-container">
    <section class="page-header-center">
        <span class="badge-pill">The Kurukoo Ecosystem</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">The Orchestration Network</h1>
        <p class="page-desc">Kurukoo is powered by a diverse network of capable participants, from local providers to automated agents.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="network-role-pathways" aria-labelledby="network-role-pathways-title"><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">One conversation, every role.</span><h2 id="network-role-pathways-title">Useful whether you need help, offer it, or grow around it.</h2><p>Start in Chat and choose the pathway that fits your role. The same identity, evidence boundaries and request lifecycle remain connected.</p></div><div class="network-role-pathways__grid"><a class="network-card" href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20a%20service"><div class="network-icon">↗</div><h3>Request a service</h3><p>Describe an everyday need and let the conversation collect the useful requirements.</p></a><a class="network-card" href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20offer%20my%20skills"><div class="network-icon">✦</div><h3>Offer your skills</h3><p>Tell Kurukoo what you do and what you can genuinely provide.</p></a><a class="network-card" href="/advertise"><div class="network-icon">□</div><h3>Grow your business</h3><p>Review disclosed business and campaign paths without claiming guaranteed demand.</p></a></div></section>

    <div class="network-grid">
        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">👤</div>
            <h3>Providers</h3>
            <p>Individual specialists whose skills can be represented in a request after the relevant profile and capability checks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🏪</div>
            <h3>Businesses</h3>
            <p>Businesses whose products or services can be represented when their relevant data and authorization boundaries are configured.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🤖</div>
            <h3>AI Agents</h3>
            <p>Software services that can participate in digital tasks when the required tools, permissions, and request path are configured.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🏅</div>
            <h3>Contributors</h3>
            <p>Community members who can contribute information or onboarding support through explicitly scoped workflows.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Partners</h3>
            <p>External organizations that may be represented after a scoped connector, authorization, and operational boundary is configured.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">📦</div>
            <h3>Delivery Providers</h3>
            <p>Delivery-related providers can participate in an eligible request when a supported delivery path is available.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="network-evidence-note" aria-label="Network evidence boundary"><div class="vision-box"><h2>Evidence before fulfilment.</h2><p>Network participation does not by itself prove availability, identity, price, inventory, payment, delivery or fulfilment. Kurukoo shows those states only when the relevant evidence and authorization are available.</p></div></section>

    <section class="network-vision">
        <div class="vision-box">
            <h2>Participate in the Network</h2>
            <p>Tell Kurukoo whether you provide a skill, represent a business, or need to discuss an integration. Capabilities and authorization remain explicit.</p>
            <div class="vision-actions">
                <a href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20offer%20my%20skills%20or%20business%20through%20Kurukoo" class="btn btn-primary">Start chatting</a>
                <a href="/partners" class="btn btn-outline">Become a Partner</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>


<style>
.network-role-pathways { margin: 54px 0 20px; }
.network-role-pathways__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.network-role-pathways__grid .network-card { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.network-evidence-note { margin: 44px 0; }
.network-evidence-note .vision-box { background: var(--cream); }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .network-role-pathways__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
